{"sections":[{"slug":"直像-逆像伴随","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"直像-逆像伴随"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间上的直像</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">逆像伴随</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"拓扑空间上的直像-逆像伴随"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间的连续映射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出了层范畴之间的一对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span>: "},{"Local":{"url":"/逆像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆像</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $f^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直像</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $f_*$; <span lang=\"zh\">逆像是直像的左</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何态射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">直像的定义是</span>\n$$\r\nf_* F (U) = F (f^{-1}(U));\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">而逆像的定义可用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表达</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $p\\colon E\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为平展空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $f^*E\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是其沿</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的拉回</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由此可知</span> $f^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持有限极限</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $f^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">左正合</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/张量-同态伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">张量</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">同态伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}